# Multiball for iomoon, at the Netherlands country default (SW40-2/3/4 =
# country 4, English text, F11).  The screens the other corpora do not have:
# the en/ and es/ walks press J twice intending a lock, but the simulator
# filled the Jupiter device from C44, a contact the Z80 reports no code for,
# so nothing was ever locked and no multiball screen was drawn.
#
# What the firmware needs, and what this script produces:
#   1. ORBITS complete.  Lane 4 (S) lights LD1; bull's-eye 1 (LCtrl+B) then
#      takes one letter.  Six pairs put [413C:0102] at its cap of 6, which is
#      the gate on Jupiter retaining a ball at all (rules 3.3.7).
#   2. Two Jupiter locks (J).  A ball on C46 is reported as remapped code
#      0x44, dispatched through CS:0527 entry 54 to sub_D9D04, which counts
#      into [4134:0030]: 1 arms Little Multiball, 2 starts Multiball (D9DBD).
#      The firmware serves a replacement ball after each lock, which is the
#      Space between them.
#   3. The drop bank is left standing, which is what selects Multiball over
#      Wonderful Thing (rules 3.3.7).
#
# Needs a seeded NVRAM with credits: on a store the firmware has not yet
# written, its own default seeding zeroes the credit triple, so coins banked
# during that first boot do not stick.  See dmd/multiball/README.md.
#
# Keys: S lane 4; LCtrl+B bull's-eye 1; J Jupiter; Space plunge; 1 start.
500 mark boot
560 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
620 mark start
900 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
960 mark plunge
1200 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1210 mark orbits-lane4-1
1260 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1270 mark orbits-letter-1
1350 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1360 mark orbits-lane4-2
1410 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1420 mark orbits-letter-2
1500 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1510 mark orbits-lane4-3
1560 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1570 mark orbits-letter-3
1650 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1660 mark orbits-lane4-4
1710 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1720 mark orbits-letter-4
1800 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1810 mark orbits-lane4-5
1860 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1870 mark orbits-letter-5
1950 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1960 mark orbits-lane4-6
2010 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
2020 mark orbits-letter-6
2100 mark orbits-complete
2220 tap 6 KEYCODE_J
2230 mark jupiter-lock-1
2470 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
2480 mark replacement-ball-1
2670 tap 6 KEYCODE_J
2680 mark jupiter-lock-2-multiball
2920 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
2930 mark replacement-ball-2
3120 tap 6 KEYCODE_Y
3130 mark multiball-play
3420 tap 6 KEYCODE_U
3430 mark multiball-play-2
3820 mark end
3970 quit
